package com.aicontrolcenter.framework.orchestration

/**
 * Characters that look like the letters of the owner notes' words ("notes from the owner", `owner_note`), and the
 * letter each one looks like (rule 24, [NoteWords]). Generated from Unicode's confusables data (UTS #39, as ICU 79.1
 * ships it): every code point outside ASCII whose skeleton is that of one of these letters, in either case, or of the
 * digit zero (read as "o") or the low line. "rn" for "m" and "vv" for "w" are matched by [NoteWords] itself.
 * Do not edit by hand; to regenerate, compare `SpoofChecker.getSkeleton` of each code point with that of each letter.
 */
